# Supabase Configuration
# =====================
# Polyticks uses a Cloudflare Worker reverse proxy to bypass ISP-level
# blocking of *.supabase.co in India. All clients (Flutter mobile, Web,
# ETL scripts) hit the proxy URL; the proxy forwards to Supabase.

# ─── Client-Side (Flutter / Web) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are bundled into the client. Safe because the proxy URL itself
# is just a hostname — real auth still goes through Supabase RLS.
SUPABASE_URL=https://polyticks-api.rex6rocks.workers.dev
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_arEuCFtXNCtnJxZFrt8PBQ__-fSxKuE

# ─── Server-Side (ETL, Supabase Edge Functions) ────────────────────────────
# Service role key bypasses RLS — NEVER ship in client builds.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-here

# ─── Optional: Third-party APIs ────────────────────────────────────────────
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# HF_API_TOKEN=
# DIGITAL_SANSAD_API_BASE=
